.SH NAME
git-work-user-list - List identities, JSON out


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work user list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the identities this repository knows about, as JSON.

.PP
JSON out by default, like every other reader; --format text prints one line
per identity, the id and the display name, which is what the bare
\fBgit work user\fR prints.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-f\fP, \fB--format\fP="json"
	Select the output formatting style. Valid values are [json,text]

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-work-user(1)\fP
